<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine cash wheat unchanged, maize weakens.</title>
<headline>Argentine cash wheat unchanged, maize weakens.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine cash wheat prices on the Buenos Aires Cereals Exchange were little changed Wednesday, while cash maize traded lower.</p>
<p>Dealers said maize prices were starting to be pushed down by the first arrivals of the harvest, and by position-closing near the end of the month.</p>
<p>Sunseed and soybean prices were somewhat weaker in very quiet trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>(( -- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
